+`scripts/check.sh` runs `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy -D warnings`, the Rust unit tests, `npm test`, the worker tests and the TypeScript checks; `scripts/check-gpu.sh` builds the experimental GPU backends and runs the frame tests on Ganesh GL and Vulkan (Mesa works). There is no hosted CI yet; a draft workflow is in [`docs/ci/`](docs/ci/).
 
